  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Wan Cheng Mountain, a grand voice, addressed as “lord supreme elder”, tells Tie Ruo Nan that her hate of evil and talent suit his Iron Mask true inheritance, and that her father had been one of his chosen seeds.",
      "chapters": [
        1340
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_wan_cheng_mountain",
        "char_tie_ruo_nan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Tie Mian Shen’s guidance, Tie Ruo Nan becomes the inheritor of Iron Mask true inheritance. Shang Qing Qing congratulates him on finding a good inheritor, and Southern Border immortals treat Tie clan’s Iron Mask true inheritance as widely known, with a strict requirement that makes a suitable inheritor hard to find. He had first chosen Tie Ruo Nan’s father, the divine investigator, but that man died on Qing Mao Mountain; after finding Tie Ruo Nan also had the qualities and talent, he chose her as the new inheritor.",
      "chapters": [
        1532
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chosen-inheritor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_mian_shen",
        "char_shang_qing_qing",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_tie_clan",
        "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a mortal duel she uses killer move Iron Mask Equipment, forming a thin black iron mask from black smoke on her face. That move comes from Iron Mask true inheritance, and with an Immortal Gu as the core it becomes an immortal killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        1533
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-display",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_iron_mask_equipment",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Mian Shen later uses immortal killer move iron mask equipment to become a ten meter giant while fighting Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1536
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-display",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan ranks floating sinking iron sand with Iron Mask true inheritance when Tie Mian Shen stacks it in battle. From Shadow Sect information he treats every super force’s signature inheritance, including this one, as closely watched, and he states that Shadow Sect never obtained Iron Mask true inheritance, only some information of it. That information names the core Immortal Gu as Justice, and says the inheriting Gu Immortal must have a heart of justice and the determination to uphold justice and punish evildoers.",
      "chapters": [
        1537
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Much later, Tie Qu Zhong recalls earlier doubts when he heard that Tie Mian Shen chose Tie Ruo Nan to inherit Iron Mask true inheritance, then fully approves her after further contact and treats her as the rising star with most potential in that generation.",
      "chapters": [
        2263
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-approval",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_qu_zhong"
      ]
    }
  ],
